['Release management','RELEASE CENTER / DELIVERY','Manage releases from one place.','Follow packaging and publication steps with Release Center, using the selected project’s application and GitHub origin.',['Windows x64 packages from a captured source commit','Resumable draft uploads and SHA-256 verification','Actions checks, download statistics and CSV exports']]
